{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scared Crow</strong>\u200b is a roguelike card game that introduces a wealth of innovative design elements. While preserving the unique appeal of the genre, it offers a fresh experience that we believe will captivate you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Combat System</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle feels less like playing cards and more like a game of chess. You and your opponent take turns making moves on a 5\u00d75 grid battlefield. The AI is exceptionally intelligent, yet with each defeat, you\u2019ll grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.poster.avif?t=1769248382\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.webm?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.mp4?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.poster.avif?t=1769248382\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.webm?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.mp4?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beyond the Endgame</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after achieving victory in a roguelike run, if you still crave more, you can continue the challenge by facing decks left behind by other players. Similarly, your own victorious decks will be recorded and become formidable opponents for others to encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/7174d5e1829cbfebc1bde7e2c5176da6.poster.avif?t=1769248382\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/7174d5e1829cbfebc1bde7e2c5176da6.webm?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/7174d5e1829cbfebc1bde7e2c5176da6.mp4?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More things</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond that, the game\u2019s <strong>Sticker System</strong>\u200b exponentially expands the possibilities for card enhancement. The <strong>Calendar System</strong>\u200b completely reimagines the traditional map progression, while <strong>randomized starting decks</strong>\u200b ensure that no two playthroughs feel the same from the very beginning. Many more surprises and engaging features await you in the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135930?t=1769248382","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/11b03323d61eab1e2c28ca969436a92ff76288b9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769248382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/73eaefac618ea6d34db6b37d14199c0f84cb3463/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769248382","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/73eaefac618ea6d34db6b37d14199c0f84cb3463/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769248382","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4252320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scared Crow</strong>\u200b is a roguelike card game that introduces a wealth of innovative design elements. While preserving the unique appeal of the genre, it offers a fresh experience that we believe will captivate you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Combat System</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle feels less like playing cards and more like a game of chess. You and your opponent take turns making moves on a 5\u00d75 grid battlefield. The AI is exceptionally intelligent, yet with each defeat, you\u2019ll grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.poster.avif?t=1769248382\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.webm?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.mp4?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.poster.avif?t=1769248382\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.webm?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.mp4?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beyond the Endgame</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after achieving victory in a roguelike run, if you still crave more, you can continue the challenge by facing decks left behind by other players. Similarly, your own victorious decks will be recorded and become formidable opponents for others to encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/7174d5e1829cbfebc1bde7e2c5176da6.poster.avif?t=1769248382\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/7174d5e1829cbfebc1bde7e2c5176da6.webm?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/7174d5e1829cbfebc1bde7e2c5176da6.mp4?t=1769248382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More things</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond that, the game\u2019s <strong>Sticker System</strong>\u200b exponentially expands the possibilities for card enhancement. The <strong>Calendar System</strong>\u200b completely reimagines the traditional map progression, while <strong>randomized starting decks</strong>\u200b ensure that no two playthroughs feel the same from the very beginning. Many more surprises and engaging features await you in the game.</p>","developers":["\u773c\u955c\u788e\u4e86"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/0c889e431c5ddb5711afab453b695f537bff62f3/header.jpg?t=176924